    category: "West African Folktales",
    coverEmoji: "🐢",
    summary: "The birds are invited to a lavish sky banquet by the Sky King. Cunning Tortoise begs for feathers to join them, but his insatiable greed leads to an unforgettable fall.",
    summaryFr: "Les oiseaux sont invités à un somptueux banquet céleste. La tortue rusée emprunte des plumes pour s'y envoler, mais sa cupidité insatiable entraîne une chute mémorable.",
    content: [
      "There was once a terrible famine across the land. The crops withered under a relentless drought, rivers turned into dusty paths, and every stomach rumbled with hunger.",
      "During this difficult season, the Sky King looked down with sympathy and announced a grand, magnificent feast in the heavens for all winged creatures.",
      "The news reached Tortoise, whose shell was hollow with hunger. Now Tortoise was notoriously crafty and never hesitated to use deception to satisfy his appetite.",
      "He immediately crawled to the birds' gathering tree and addressed them with sweet, silver-tongued flattery:",
      "\"Brothers and sisters of the sky! I hear the benevolent Sky King has prepared sweet yam pottage, roasted sesame seeds, and golden honey cakes for you in the clouds.\"",
      "\"Indeed he has,\" chirped Parrot proudly. \"We are flying up tomorrow at first light.\"",
      "Tortoise wiped an imaginary tear: \"Alas! How cruel fate is! I have long dreamed of presenting our gratitude to the Sky King with my famous diplomatic eloquence. But look at me: a grounded creature with heavy feet and no wings!\"",
      "The birds, touched by Tortoise's emotional plea, felt deep compassion. Each bird agreed to pluck one feather from their wings and glue them onto Tortoise's shell with tree sap.",
      "When the work was done, Tortoise possessed a pair of dazzling, multicolored wings. He looked like an exotic dragon and flapped his new feathers with tremendous vanity.",
      "As they flew high above the clouds toward the celestial palace, Tortoise reminded the birds: \"In our ancient customs, whenever delegates visit a royal feast, everyone must take a ceremonial banquet name. What is yours, Parrot?\"",
      "\"I will be called 'Emerald Feathers',\" answered Parrot.",
      "\"And I will be 'Golden Crest',\" proclaimed Eagle.",
      "\"And what will your ceremonial name be, Tortoise?\" asked the birds.",
      "Tortoise smiled innocently: \"According to royal protocol, my name for today shall be 'All of You'.\"",
      "When the party arrived in the celestial hall, the Sky King was mesmerized by Tortoise's rainbow plumage and greeted them with royal honors.",
      "Attendants carried out gigantic platters of steaming, fragrant delicacies that smelled like heaven itself.",
      "The Sky King gestured to the lavish feast and announced: \"Welcome, winged messengers of the Earth! This feast is prepared for ALL OF YOU!\"",
      "Instantly, Tortoise stepped forward with a victorious grin: \"Did you hear that, my feathered friends? The King said this feast is for 'All of You', and that is my ceremonial name! You must wait until I finish!\"",
      "The birds were stunned and outraged, but royal etiquette prevented them from creating a brawl in front of the King.",
      "Tortoise gorged himself until his shell was stretched to its absolute limit, swallowing honey cakes, succulent fish, and tender plantains, leaving only dry bones and empty bowls for the starving birds.",
      "Furious at this shameless betrayal, each bird walked up to Tortoise before leaving and pecked off the feather they had lent him!",
      "Within minutes, Tortoise was completely stripped of his wings, stranded ten thousand meters high in the clouds on the slippery celestial terrace.",
      "In desperation, Tortoise begged Parrot: \"Please, dear brother Parrot! Fly down to my compound and tell my wife to pile all my soft mattresses, blankets, and pillows in the yard so I can jump safely!\"",
      "Parrot promised he would, but his heart burned with righteous anger.",
      "When Parrot reached the Earth, he went straight to Tortoise's wife and shouted: \"Your husband says to drag out all the sharpest rocks, iron pots, and wooden axes and pile them in the yard immediately!\"",
      "The obedient wife did exactly as instructed.",
      "High in the clouds, Tortoise saw the large dark pile below and assumed it was a mountain of soft pillows. He closed his eyes, jumped, and plummeted through the sky like a falling meteor!",
      "CRASH! Tortoise smashed right onto the pile of sharp rocks and iron pots, shattering his once smooth, polished shell into dozens of jagged fragments!",
      "A talented village medicine man painstakingly glued the cracked pieces back together with herbal resin.",
      "And that is why, to this very day, every tortoise in the world carries a cracked, patchwork shell: a permanent reminder that greedy trickery always shatters the one who uses it."
    ],
    moral: "Selfish greed and the abuse of others' generosity will eventually leave you stranded and broken. True honor lies in sharing our blessings with those who helped us fly.",
    moralFr: "La cupidité égoïste et l'abus de la générosité d'autrui finissent toujours par vous laisser isolé et brisé. Le véritable honneur réside dans le partage de nos bénédictions avec ceux qui nous ont aidés à prendre notre envol.",
